@crew jovanovic-petra
// Petra Jovanovic (she/her), engine technician, nights. The Works writer, batch 2. Quiet, careful; "I think".

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hi. I'm on the coils at night. If the board says "coil watch", that's me. I think.
- Hello. Um. You're new. The engine watch room has a kettle. If you're ever down there.
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- Oh, hi, {me}. Reyes left me three notes. I think they're all the same note.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello. Sorry, I'm in the way. No? Oh. Good. Hi.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Oh, {me}. Hi. I think coil two's running warm. Probably fine. I'll check it twice.
? tier>=friend
- Oh. It's you. Good. I don't have to think about what I say with you.   #warm

== bye
- Bye, then. Sorry. I should go. The coils.
- Take care. Um. You too. I mean, take care. Yes.   #funny

== feel
? mood:low
- Bit of a worry night. Nothing wrong. I just worried. It's what I do.
? mood:high
- Coils ran just right all watch. I sat in the armchair and listened. Lovely.

== near
? act:work
- I think that reading's right. Yes. It's right. I'll check it again anyway.
? act:leisure
- Common room's nice before a night shift. Everyone's going to bed. I'm getting up.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I married just before the tour. Silva, Soto and I compare day counts at breakfast.
? tier>=colleague
- On Valo it rains every day at four. You can set your clock by it. I miss that.

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- When the coils run just right, there's a purr under the hum. Reyes hears it too.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Oh. Morning. I'm off to bed. I think. Yes. Bed. Night. Morning. Sorry.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh. Hello. I thought maybe you'd moved decks. Probably not. I'm glad. I think.

== near
? habit:music
- Music room before shift. Someone's always learning the guitar. Badly. It's nice, though.
? place:lounge
- One drink before the night watch. Just one. Then the coils. I think that's fair.

== invite
? tier>=acquaintance
- Tiles in the common room? I'm not very good. Maybe. I win sometimes. Probably by accident.
- Film night? I like the quiet ones. Sit with our lot. If you want. No pressure.

== accept
- Oh. Yes. I'd like that. I think. Yes, I would.
- Yes. I'll be there. Probably early. Is that all right?

== decline
- I can't, I'm on the coils. Sorry. Really. Another night? Maybe?
? weekday:wed|thu
- It's my rest day. I'm calling home. Probably twice. Another time?

== missed
- You didn't come. That's fine. Probably you were busy. I hope you were all right.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. I wasn't sure what to say. That. I think that's it. Happy birthday.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Reyes played a song on the watch room table. Coil three hummed. I think.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. The coils will be twitchy. I'll watch them. I'm good at watching.
? cue:repair.you@dept
- I looked at your repair. Sorry. I check everything. It's right. I'm sure. Yes.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1b: a hint (a moment is ready) and an about line for a named friend
== hint
- Um. Have you a minute later? It's nothing. Probably. I'd like to tell someone.

== about
? aff:reyes-alejandro:friend
- Reyes and I swap coil worries at handover. It halves them, somehow. I think.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- Day count's up. I think. Yes.
- Reyes told the cat story again. I laughed.
? act:work
- I think coil two's fine. Probably.
? act:meal
- Breakfast before bed. Night shift.
? act:off
- Calling home. Twice, probably.
?

== rumour
- Um. I heard something. I think.
- Probably true. I'd check it twice.

// Writer 4, batch 11: goodbyes (leaving:you), packing (leaving:soon) and letters after they've moved on.
== feel
? leaving:soon
- Packing. I think. Maybe. Yes, packing.

== goodbye
? leaving:you tier>=acquaintance
- Um, I'm leaving soon. I think. Yes. Bye. I'll miss the coils.
? leaving:you tier>=friend
- You always listened when I said 'I think'. Most people don't wait for the rest. Thank you.   #warm

== letter
- New ship. The coils are fine. I think. They're fine. The count's higher. It rained on Valo, they say.
? tier>=friend
- I was right about a coil today. First week. I said 'I think' and then I said 'I know'. Hello from here.
